#. event 0F (calledFromAnim)
msgctxt "bark 04C3:02FB"
msgid "All right, one more time... "
msgstr ""

#. event 0F (calledFromAnim)
msgctxt "bark 04C3:032C"
msgid "Where were you last night? "
msgstr ""

#. event 0F (calledFromAnim)
msgctxt "bark 04C3:0373"
msgid "Really, I was at home with my poor, sick mother. "
msgstr ""

#. event 0F (calledFromAnim)
msgctxt "bark 04C3:03B6"
msgid "Why have you not paid your taxes? "
msgstr ""

#. event 0F (calledFromAnim)
msgctxt "bark 04C3:03EE"
msgid "Please sir, I have no more money. "
msgstr ""

#. event 0F (calledFromAnim)
msgctxt "bark 04C3:0432"
msgid "I should throw you in the dungeon! "
msgstr ""

#. event 0F (calledFromAnim)
msgctxt "bark 04C3:046B"
msgid "But-but who will feed my children? "
msgstr ""

#. event 0F (calledFromAnim)
msgctxt "bark 04C3:04AB"
msgid "I know that you were in on it! "
msgstr ""

#. event 0F (calledFromAnim)
msgctxt "bark 04C3:04E7"
msgid "Confess, and I shall not torture you! "
msgstr ""

#. event 0F (calledFromAnim)
msgctxt "bark 04C3:052D"
msgid "I beg of you, sir! "
msgstr ""

#. event 0F (calledFromAnim)
msgctxt "bark 04C3:0555"
msgid "Please let me go! "
msgstr ""

#. event 0F (calledFromAnim)
msgctxt "bark 04C3:05A9"
msgid "Right, I shall torture you then! "
msgstr ""

#. event 0F (calledFromAnim)
msgctxt "bark 04C3:0603"
msgid "I swear on my mother's grave that I had no part in that. "
msgstr ""

#. event 0F (calledFromAnim)
msgctxt "bark 04C3:0621"
msgid "Really? "
msgstr ""

#. event 0F (calledFromAnim)
msgctxt "bark 04C3:0663"
msgid "I thought you said your mother was sick...? "
msgstr ""

#. event 0F (calledFromAnim)
msgctxt "bark 04C3:0681"
msgid "Well... "
msgstr ""

#. event 0F (calledFromAnim)
msgctxt "bark 04C3:06B5"
msgid "She...she is sick. Very sick. "
msgstr ""

#. event 0F (calledFromAnim)
msgctxt "bark 04C3:06E4"
msgid "She will be dead soon... "
msgstr ""

#. event 0F (calledFromAnim)
msgctxt "bark 04C3:073F"
msgid "Tell me what I need to know! "
msgstr ""

#. event 0F (calledFromAnim)
msgctxt "bark 04C3:0772"
msgid "I grow tired of your lies... "
msgstr ""

#. event 0F (calledFromAnim)
msgctxt "bark 04C3:07E0"
msgid "Please, I beg mercy in the name of the Tempest! "
msgstr ""

#. event 0F (calledFromAnim)
msgctxt "bark 04C3:0819"
msgid "You know Mordea never shows mercy! "
msgstr ""

#. event 0F (calledFromAnim)
msgctxt "bark 04C3:0872"
msgid "She may feed you to the Lurker rather than put you in the dungeon! "
msgstr ""

#. event 0F (calledFromAnim)
msgctxt "bark 04C3:08B0"
msgid "Please, I beg of you, have mercy on me! "
msgstr ""
